What is printed as a result of executing the following code segment?

```java
class Pair {
    private int first, second;
    public Pair(int f, int s) { first = f; second = s; }
    public int getFirst() { return first; }
    public int getSecond() { return second; }
    public void set(int f, int s) { first = f; second = s; }
}

public static void swap(int x, int y) { int t = x; x = y; y = t; }
public static void swap(Pair p) { int t = p.getFirst(); p.set(p.getSecond(), t); }
```

```java
int a = 3, b = 8;
swap(a, b);
Pair p = new Pair(3, 8);
swap(p);
System.out.println(a + " " + b + " " + p.getFirst() + " " + p.getSecond());
```

